  "details": "When i look back streams, mine and my friend, i saw something not right.\n\nOne player is just missed for strange reason. Sadone cannot see it, but room is same and others players can see at same time. The Camera window showed exact same picture.\nThe missing player is active, she can see me and wave too. So it's cleary just forgotten at Sadone side.\n\nWhy can VRChat even forgot complete players? That is really bad networking system! VRChat should not forgot some players! Because that will causes misunderstandings and you might make some players angry because you step right in his/her face and ignoring them. Not great.",
